	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d33r0101_hakase2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アララギ『あら……
[Name:TrainerName ]　じゃない？▼
あなたも　ここに　めをつけるなんて
さすが　ずかんの　もちぬし！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-31T09:54:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-29T03:04:57" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アララギ『あら……
[Name:TrainerName ]　じゃない？▼
あなたも　ここに　めをつけるなんて
さすが　図鑑の　持ち主！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-31T09:54:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-29T03:05:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・フラグ成立で出現
・GRIDX＝16、GRIDZ＝22
　posで会話スタート
　！マーク表示後に主人公に隣接してメッセージ
・0＝主人公名前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-31T09:53:58" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>HAKASE2
アララギ娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-29T03:04:27" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T07:17:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d33r0101_hakase2_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>それにしても　この　くうかん……▼
ことばで　いいあわらしにくい
なにかで　みちているわね……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-24T08:30:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-29T03:09:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>それにしても　この空間……▼
言葉で　言い表しにくい
なにかで　満ちているわね……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-24T08:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-29T03:09:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・hakase2_01以降から
　event_01表示まで繰り返し</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-29T03:10:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>HAKASE2
アララギ娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-29T03:06:03" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T07:17:24" />
		</AttributeCell>
